      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think VRChat wants to verify the age of their user themself which is why they went with a third-party (probably for legal reasons as well). I don't think there are any other ways of verifying someone age without handing your ID or a valid document that can prove without a doubt that you are not lying about your age.",
